    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d146-a3">

                <pb facs="0259" n="179" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg179"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Dr. Canright to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chentu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-28"><hi rendition="#italic">August 28,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Situation still serious. Urge new viceroy hasten.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Canright</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
